        {
          "text": "Sibhoono abhantö bha Yuta bhagaita bhaara bhonsui bharëëye inikö guisiira Ömögambi Amoni; hakurua bhagakora Yosia, ömoona waae köbha ömögambi kuibhaga reee.",
